Gd2By0jgcKQ8VVaA2aTf6mTuWZmE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTltBVO747Wekp_yUr0cTbulfb3tTklCTHXGZR1-IHQNg&oe=6AFDC5F6"}, "display_name": "Remembrance", "keywords": ["puzzle", "adventure", "fantasy", "narrative"], "long_description": "# Unravel a Mind in Crisis. Chapter One.\nRemembrance invites you to dive deep into the fractured memories of Professor Isaac Nemeth, a brilliant but broken scientist whose work may hold the key to humanity's survival. Guiding Dr. Bell, a psychologist, you'll navigate surreal landscapes, solve intricate puzzles, and uncover haunting truths buried in his subconscious.\n\nThis is Chapter One of the Remembrance saga.\n# A World of Mystery and Emotion\nExplore a series of richly detailed, dreamlike environments that represent the professor\u2019s most pivotal and painful moments. From a star-filled childhood bedroom holding the promise of a bright future to the chaos of his shattered laboratory and a broken life, every memory offers a glimpse into the choices that shaped the man and the secrets he\u2019s desperate to hide.\n# Key Features: \n- **Immersive VR Gameplay**: Experience the game\u2019s intricate world and emotionally charged story from a fully immersive, first-person perspective.\n- **Thought-Provoking Puzzles**: Solve mind-bending challenges that mirror the professor\u2019s fragmented psyche.\n- **Emotional Narrative**: Dive into a deeply human story of ambition, loss, and redemption.\n- **Richly Crafted Worlds**: Traverse environments that blend memory, emotion, and a lifetime of regret.\n- **~1\u20131.5 Hours of Story:** A focused first chapter into Isaac's fractured mind.\n# What Truths Will You Uncover First?\nRemembrance is more than a game \u2014 it's a journey through the depths of memory, morality, and hope. Chapter One is where it begins.\n{997666959512873}", "short_description": "Chapter One of a mind-bending VR narrative puzzle saga. Step into the fractured mind of a dying scientist in Remembrance. Piece together broken memories, uncover devastating truths, and take the first steps toward a mystery that reaches far beyond one man's mind."}]}, "developer_name": "NIEKO", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://niekoplay.com/privacy-policy-remembrance/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NIEKO", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://niekoplay.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "37153963114248075"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828038_1516154333351953_975929964084264152_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3y-WNe68uO0Q7kNvwHipBRP&_nc_oc=Adr6vBRajbHt4d66um6FSNAtLHnJ4mi5iiff9ZFP57sWsI7PUcIrBorqjPr6Vpc80qU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQLUXXrphZsGuMR0fzic21ViZ_2uXmC8gzs2Q159DQgXA&oe=6AFDC7B4"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Remembrance", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Adventure", "id": "2691890164460465"}, {"topic_name": "Narrative", "id": "1008279844328894"}, {"topic_name": "Puzzle", "id": "3779